      "refersTo": "candidate-card",
      "description": "Selected card using the real missing-image treatment; no fabricated product photo or financial result.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-control ds-card\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-photo\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m3 3 18 18M21 15V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H9M3 9v10a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14M3 15l4-4 10 10M14 14l1-1 6 6\"/><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"8\" r=\"1\"/></svg><span>저장된 이미지가 없습니다</span></span><span class=\"ds-card-copy\">저장 후보</span><span class=\"ds-card-meta\">판매가 미확정</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-card{font-family:ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, \"Pretendard\", \"Apple SD Gothic Neo\", system-ui, sans-serif;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0;max-width:300px;width:100%;padding:9px;text-align:left;border:1px solid var(--line,#E0E6E1);border-radius:14px;background:var(--surface,#FFFFFF);color:var(--text,#182C25);cursor:pointer;transition:border-color .18s,background .18s;}.ds-card:hover{border-color:var(--accent-line,#A4C2B1);background:var(--surface-2,#F2F5F1);}.ds-card[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{border-color:var(--accent,#1E4D3D);outline:1px solid var(--accent,#1E4D3D);outline-offset:0;}.ds-photo{width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.45;border-radius:9px;background:var(--surface-2,#F2F5F1);display:grid;align-content:center;justify-items:center;gap:10px;overflow:hidden;color:var(--text-2,#526159);font-size:11px;}.ds-card-copy{padding:10px 3px 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.5;}.ds-card-meta{padding:0 3px 4px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2,#526159);}.ds-card:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#1E4D3D);outline-offset:3px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-card{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Inspector Hold Notice",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "candidate-inspector",
      "description": "Inspector surface and the implemented unresolved-profitability warning.",
      "html": "<aside class=\"ds-inspector\" aria-label=\"선택 상품 검토\"><h2>상품 검토</h2><div class=\"ds-hold\"><strong>수익성 확정 보류</strong><p>배송비·수요·판매 적합성 확인 전에는 확정하지 않습니다.</p></div><p class=\"ds-lock\">상품 등록·배송 신청 미실행</p></aside>",
      "css": ".ds-inspector{font-family:ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, \"Pretendard\", \"Apple SD Gothic Neo\", system-ui, sans-serif;max-width:340px;padding:18px;border:1px solid var(--line,#E0E6E1);border-radius:14px;background:var(--surface,#FFFFFF);color:var(--text,#182C25);}.ds-inspector h2{font-size:16px;font-weight:650;margin:0 0 16px;}.ds-hold{padding:13px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--warn-soft,#FDF3E2);color:var(--warn,#9A6410);font-size:13px;}.ds-hold p{margin:5px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;}.ds-lock{font-size:11px;color:var(--text-2,#526159);margin:10px 0 0;text-align:center;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Evidence Disclosure",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "disclosure",
      "description": "Native progressive disclosure for existing review evidence.",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-details\"><summary>배송비 범위·옵션별 추정 근거</summary><p>추정 근거와 시나리오는 전체 조사·검토 기록에서 확인하세요. 확인되지 않은 값은 0원으로 처리하지 않습니다.</p></details>",
      "css": ".ds-details{font-family:ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, \"Pretendard\", \"Apple SD Gothic Neo\", system-ui, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:var(--text,#182C25);border-top:1px solid var(--line,#E0E6E1);padding-top:13px;max-width:360px;}.ds-details summary{cursor:pointer;}.ds-details summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#1E4D3D);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-details p{line-height:1.5;}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Procurement Workbench",
    "overview": "A calm procurement workbench: warm stone grounds, white surfaces, and forest green for actions and selection. The system supports PC comparison of stored product evidence with standard controls and quiet borders.\n\nThe chosen C direction gives real product images room without turning the interface into a promotion. System fonts are intentional workhorse typography. Missing images and unresolved economics remain legible parts of the review.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Warm stone and white surfaces",
      "Forest green action and selection",
      "Actual stored imagery with explicit fallback",
      "Compact evidence and aligned financial values"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Evidence Rule",
        "body": "Image presence never implies usage rights, profitability, or transaction readiness.",
        "section": "colors"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do retain the shared theme variables for new surfaces and controls.",
      "Do show stored image URLs with contain fitting and a visible missing-image fallback.",
      "Do retain visible focus and tabular figures for financial comparison.",
      "Do keep source-image provenance in candidate records and treat previews as internal review."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't replace absent source images with invented products or the generated mockup.",
      "Don't use green to imply cleared profitability or permission to transact.",
      "Don't substitute zero for unknown costs or describe contribution estimates as confirmed net profit.",
      "Don't add a webfont dependency to reproduce the approved system stack."
    ]
  }
}
